      "instance_name": "child",
      "label": "a young child sitting on the ground",
      "description": "A child wearing a blue helmet and a brown jacket is sitting on a red paved surface, appearing to be crying or upset. The child is positioned next to a fallen bicycle, suggesting they have just fallen off. The child's posture and facial expression convey vulnerability and distress, making them a central and emotionally salient figure in the image.",
