      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Hateful",
      "description": "The meme directly attacks a specific political group (Trump supporters) by associating them with a vulnerable child and simultaneously uses a racial slur ('fucking mexicans') to dehumanize and incite hatred against a specific ethnic group (Mexicans). This is a direct hateful attack based on protected characteristics (political affiliation and ethnicity).",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
